        "observations": "Inspected1280×519 wide cliff panorama. The continuous horseshoe scarp has horizontal rock bands,an irregular upper rock cap,recessed rectangular pillared galleries,selected large arched chaitya fronts and a narrow connecting terrace. Trees obscure the lower ravine;no individual cave dimensions or survey heights are inferred from pixels."
