        "observations": "Inspected960×720 upper Cave19 facade:large horseshoe-like arched window with concentric molding,projecting layered cornices,side pilasters and dense sculptural registers. Geometry abstracts bands,niches and arch silhouette;exact sculptures and artwork are not copied."
