        "observations": "Inspected960×640 Cave26 exterior:large upper arched window with radial framing,three lower dark doorway groups,stepped carved jambs,a broken horizontal rock ledge and shallow relief registers. Used as an original coarse facade reconstruction. An additional picture establishes the lower facade omitted by the Cave19 crop."
